DebatePHP

This PHP adaptation includes the supplied Module:Debate and public Wikidebats
translation/template snapshots. Wikidebats content is published under
Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 4.0. Original revision identifiers and
permanent links are in tests/fixtures/revisions.json. The supplied module is
retained verbatim in resources/Module-Debate.reference.lua.

The compatibility routines adapt algorithms and behavior from MediaWiki and
Scribunto REL1_43, published under GNU GPL version 2 or later, including the
mw.text.nowiki rules and mw.html strip-marker escaping. See docs/equivalence.md
for source links and the upstream authorship notices in those sources.

NativeTags adapts the HTML Tags extension version 0.3 by Yaron Koren
(GPL-2.0-or-later), retaining its expansion, attribute filtering and escaping
semantics. The English/French compatibility messages retain their original
translation author metadata in i18n/. ShortDescription is called through its
registered MediaWiki parser function; its implementation is not copied.

The PHP adaptation is distributed under GNU GPL version 3 or later, using the
compatibility of CC BY-SA 4.0 with GPLv3 for adapted material. Original source
snapshots retain their source licenses and attribution. A copy of GPLv3 is in
LICENSE. See https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/ for CC BY-SA 4.0.

Version 0.5.0 merges the second user-provided native-tag Debate archive with
the Module:Argument port. The exact Argument source is preserved in
resources/Module-Argument.reference.lua; no revision history was supplied.
Shared native tag behavior follows the HTML Tags 0.3 source and MediaWiki
REL1_43 parser semantics. Existing source attribution and licenses apply.
